\section*{Times \& Division Tables (1--12)}
\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{Times \& Division Tables (1--12)}

The grid below gives every multiplication fact from $1\times1$ to $12\times12$. Row $\times$ column = the cell. It is also every division fact: find the answer to a division inside the grid, then its row is one factor and its column is the other.

\begin{center}
